## 4. Constructors and validation

```rust
impl Doi {
    pub fn parse(s: &str) -> Result<Self, ErrorCode>;
    pub fn as_str(&self) -> &str;
}

impl ArxivId {
    pub fn parse(s: &str) -> Result<Self, ErrorCode>;
    pub fn as_str(&self) -> &str;
}

impl Ref {
    pub fn parse(s: &str) -> Result<Self, ErrorCode>;
    pub fn safekey(&self) -> Safekey;
}
```

`parse` returns `Err(ErrorCode::InvalidRef)` for malformed input.

